fun (bf : Values.block) (base : BinNums.Z) (bi : Values.block) (input count : BinNums.Z) =>
@Maps.PTree.set Values.val _n (Values.Vlong (Integers.Int64.repr count))
  (@Maps.PTree.set Values.val _x (Values.Vptr bi (Integers.Ptrofs.repr input))
     (@Maps.PTree.set Values.val _frame (Values.Vptr bf (Integers.Ptrofs.repr base))
